+*   **Ray AABB Intersection**:
+    $$ \mathbf{invRd} = \frac{1}{\mathbf{rd}}, \quad \mathbf{t0} = (\mathbf{p0} - \mathbf{ro}) \cdot \mathbf{invRd}, \quad \mathbf{t1} = (\mathbf{p1} - \mathbf{ro}) \cdot \mathbf{invRd} $$
+    $$ \mathbf{tmin} = \min(\mathbf{t0}, \mathbf{t1}), \quad \mathbf{tmax} = \max(\mathbf{t0}, \mathbf{t1}) $$
+    $$ ftmin = \max(tmin_x, tmin_y, tmin_z), \quad ftmax = \min(tmax_x, tmax_y, tmax_z) $$
+    $$ \mathbf{hit} = \mathbf{ro} + (ftmin \cdot \mathbf{rd}) $$
+    Intersection occurs if $ftmin \le ftmax$ [S2, unofficial].
